<!--Post: 13276--><!--Time: 1114739454-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13276"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, April 28, 2005 - 6:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.kansas.com/multimedia/kansas/archive/btk/042705radermotionfinal.pdf" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/multimedia/kansas/archive/bt k/042705radermotionfinal.pdf</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13276-->
<!--Post: 13313--><!--Time: 1114907516-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13313"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, April 30, 2005 - 5:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lots of names on this witness list whom I know personally, including my Mom! I guess I need to call the DA&#39;s office. <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/multimedia/kansas/archive/btk/043005motiontoendorse.pdf" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/multimedia/kansas/archive/bt k/043005motiontoendorse.pdf</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13313-->
<!--Post: 13314--><!--Time: 1114907675-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13314"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, April 30, 2005 - 5:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Did anyone else notice that they didn&#39;t endorse the Raders or the Dietz&#39;s?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13314-->
<!--Post: 13349--><!--Time: 1115132187-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13349"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 7:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky - can they add witness&#39;s as they go along...now that we know he has plead not guilty. <BR>It just really pi&#42;&#42;es me off to think of what this is going to cost Wichita. <BR>The demon just wants his name in lights...probably allready contemplating a movie...the bastard... <BR>Did you call the DA about your mom being on the list?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13349-->
<!--Post: 13356--><!--Time: 1115134415-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13356"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 8:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes, they can add more witnesses but only up to a certain time. I hadn&#39;t called the DA&#39;s office yet pending demon @&#42;&#42;&#39;&#42; plea. I guess I&#39;ll have to now. Else- I&#39;m so pissed off I&#39;m shaking! I&#39;m tellin ya - my Mom would be ready to skin this bastard alive.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13356-->
<!--Post: 13357--><!--Time: 1115135090-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13357"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 8:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I know Rocky, it&#39;s all gonna be okay.  Somehow. I hope. <BR>I am shaking to...the piece of sh&#42;t...I can  hardly write...Now that Charlie is in town...they better keep him under lock down...bullet proof vest...seclusion... <BR>Charlie WILL get him. <BR>I hope your Dad is doing okay...this has probably upset him alot... <BR>and your mom... <BR>just know that she all ready knows the outcome of all of this... <BR>I just wish she could tell us. <BR>God Bless.... <BR>Let&#39;s stay in touch thru this trial Rocky - don&#39;t stop posting - <BR>I will be going back to DooDah the end of May, My nephew is graduating... <BR>I am aprehensive about it....haven&#39;t been back for awhile... <BR>Hang in there... <BR>Else<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13357-->
<!--Post: 13366--><!--Time: 1115155408-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13366"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 2:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Elsewhere, <BR>Charlie Otero isn&#39;t going to &#39;get&#39; Dennis Rader or anyone else. He got his verbal lick in today and that&#39;s cool but don&#39;t try to wish him into being an angel of vengence. <BR>He&#39;s a man on parole, trying to turn his life around who is undoubtably happy that a suspected killer of his family is aprehended and will face trail with the probabilty of never living outside of a jail cell again. <BR>Don&#39;t try to turn Charlie Otero into a killer too.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13366-->
<!--Post: 13382--><!--Time: 1115176539-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13382"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, May 03, 2005 - 8:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Johno - obviously this is an emotional day for Else and I. We are both from Wichita/Park City and our feelings towards demon @&#42;&#42; are personal. Both of us really would never want Charlie to waste another minute of his life trying to right a wrong that this monster has created. We both really want justice to prevail and demon @&#42;&#42; to waste away his demonic thoughts in a cell the rest of his life until the day he dies.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13382-->
<!--Post: 13403--><!--Time: 1115218752-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13403"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, May 04, 2005 - 7:59 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks Rocky - Johno tho - you are right...I get a little carried away on a very personal level.  But Charlie does deserve to get his life back...I donot wish for him to also become a killer... I was out of line..<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13403-->
